      "message": "[error] Line 714: 🔴 `applyRequestsDeferredByRecovery()` calls `processRemainingRequest()` while holding `callMutex_`. `processRemainingRequest()` can execute `holdCb_`/`resumeCb_`, so external callbacks may run under the call mutex and re-enter call methods, creating deadlock/re-entrancy risk on recovery completion. Move `processRemainingRequest()` out of the locked region (capture needed state under lock, release lock, then process callbacks).",
